{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53918","headline":"还丹口诀 · 轩辕集","name":"还丹口诀","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"世上喧喧车马人，红颜绿鬓不长春。\n药术相传万甲子，学者茫茫寻不真。\n寻不真，莫生嗔，盖爲黄芽不得真。\n铅是铅，汞是汞，世上之人总错用。\n草黄芽，木黄芽，世上闻说也乱夸。\n自古口传不形纸，烧者徒劳尽破家。\n堪分付，递相传，固济元来此道门。\n妄传非人遭殃祸，父子麤疎不合言。\n黑服硫黄烧不烟，饵之中寿几千年。\n更加金室乾坤内，脱世浮空得飞仙。\n（《大还丹照监》）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"轩辕集","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53918.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53918","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}